colon-subdirs (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Treat leading colon-paths (:foo/bar) as BASE "/" (same as /:foo/bar).
  * For :mv/:cp destinations, substitute the first ':' with '/' safely.
  * Add built-in rewrite backends under src/rewrite/ for each wrapped command.
  * Honor COLON_WRAP: unset execs $0 stem from PATH; COLON_WRAP=<name> execs
    that binary; COLON_WRAP=0 runs the rewrite implementation.
  * Update man pages, README, bash-completion notes, and unit tests for the
    empty-left path form and COLON_WRAP.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Fri, 17 Jul 2026 02:46:00 +0800

colon-subdirs (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: colon-path wrappers for mv, cp, zip, rm, rmdir, scp,
    unzip, and rsync. Each command is built standalone (no shared library).
    Installs :cmd symlinks to colon-cmd binaries.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Fri, 17 Jul 2026 01:00:00 +0800
